    "created_at": "2024-02-28T14:49:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-28T14:49:24Z",
    "body": "Making `auto` work for eager images when layout is available makes resource selection a race condition, which the spec generally tries hard to avoid. It should be deterministic and predictable.\r\n\r\nIn https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9648 we changed processing to use the next value instead of 100vw if the image doesn't allow auto-sizes (e.g. is eager). See https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9493/files#diff-41cf6794ba4200b839c53531555f0f3998df4cbb01a4d5cb0b94e3ca5e23947dR30070-R30071",
